{"lines":[{"bbox":[0.065406976888631618,0.87030075186365052,0.061046510176225144,0.013157895032097411],"confidence":1,"text":"Footnotes"},{"bbox":[0.066860469867988492,0.84398496293685354,0.22529069380326705,0.013157893910127449],"confidence":1,"text":"1. Application fees include a $37.00 technology fee"},{"bbox":[0.066860488282557223,0.82330827081105318,0.57703485662286935,0.015037593841552788],"confidence":1,"text":"2. Administrative determination includes zoning interpretations, determinations of nonconformity, and zoning compliance requests."},{"bbox":[0.065406990205573529,0.8045112786793347,0.32848835338245741,0.01315789391012756],"confidence":1,"text":"3. Daycare permit includes childcare, adultcare, and group home permits."},{"bbox":[0.065406976574268472,0.78571428605715432,0.68459300648082388,0.013157893910127449],"confidence":1,"text":"4. Residential site plan includes applications for decks, accessory structures, agricultural buildings, and septic site plans. (2nd kitchens in house excluded)"},{"bbox":[0.066860470723495588,0.76503759442964803,0.49127907492897721,0.013197699715109423],"confidence":1,"text":"5. A combined maximum of two (2) waiver\/deviation requests per land use application is included (no extra fee)."},{"bbox":[0.065406981028054409,0.73684210558253016,0.71075578169389197,0.013157894471112486],"confidence":1,"text":"6. Board of Adjustment includes applications for lot area or lot area in combination with other variance, daycare spacing, setbacks, physical dimension, structural"},{"bbox":[0.063953501354180015,0.71588235278269785,0.66279069380326705,0.013529411764705901],"confidence":1,"text":"location, bulk limitations, parking, signs, distance separation, landscaping (above the administrative relief amount) are included in this application fee."},{"bbox":[0.066860474261177694,0.69352941203825058,0.34447673450816763,0.013529411764705901],"confidence":1,"text":"7. Commerical Site Development Plan, Major includes new tower applications"},{"bbox":[0.065407001758431726,0.66917293286166557,0.71075578169389197,0.013180008495555118],"confidence":1,"text":"8. Final Plat Amendment, Level 1- same or less lots, plat note modification or deletion, remove completed plat restriction, release of plat restriction w\/Subdivision"},{"bbox":[0.063953501499667179,0.64823529431344051,0.72819763183593744,0.01529854045194734],"confidence":1,"text":"Improvement Agreement (SIA) to replace condition, reconsideration of expired plat, change defined access locations; change floodplain boundary or restriction; non-"},{"bbox":[0.06540696623261609,0.62941176497645079,0.58284884366122158,0.013529411764706012],"confidence":1,"text":"substantial change in water supply; lot line\/building envelope adjustment; vacation of plat-no right of way. Hearings may be required."},{"bbox":[0.065406968377750285,0.60526315823760535,0.72093023126775568,0.01315789391012756],"confidence":1,"text":"9. Final Plat Amendment, Level 2- additional lots or tracts, significant roadway changes; substantial change to water supply; may need preliminary plan amendment."},{"bbox":[0.065407000470043442,0.58058823528023917,0.7267441628196023,0.015294117647058791],"confidence":1,"text":"10. Major Revision is defined as any one of the following: 1) A change in land use type(s) for 25% or more of the existing Sketch Plan area; 2) 25% or greater increase in"},{"bbox":[0.066860483124256478,0.5617647056485553,0.71802323774857946,0.013529411764706012],"confidence":1,"text":"projected population or employment; 3) 25% or greater addition or area to the original Sketch Plan; 4) 10% or greater decrease in total park and\/or open space area."},{"bbox":[0.065406979458947079,0.54294117633802097,0.57848838112571022,0.013529411764706012],"confidence":1,"text":"Minor Revision is any revision that does not meet the thresholds of a major revision. All increases must be elevated to PC and BoCC."},{"bbox":[0.066860486095855709,0.52058823555441336,0.69767439408735787,0.01352941176470579],"confidence":1,"text":"11. A major sketch plan is any plan encompassing over 200 acres in area or more than 100 dwelling units, or including more than 10 acres of developable non-"},{"bbox":[0.065406975206513063,0.50176470586007293,0.084302326549183265,0.011393188588759484],"confidence":1,"text":"residential space."},{"bbox":[0.066860471042478525,0.47744360884363468,0.72093023126775568,0.015037593841552677],"confidence":1,"text":"12. Minor Special Use-applies to applications for Rural Home Occupation as a Special Use, Extended Family Housing, Agricultural Structure Exemption as a Special"},{"bbox":[0.06540698407888261,0.45864661673837148,0.17877906105735086,0.015037593841552788],"confidence":1,"text":"Use , and Minor Kennel as a Special Use"},{"bbox":[0.065406986644303361,0.43411764729683056,0.21656975486061789,0.013529411764705901],"confidence":1,"text":"13. Fee is determined based on application type."},{"bbox":[0.065406974805410259,0.4076470589892448,0.33575580943714489,0.013529411764705901],"confidence":1,"text":"14. Recording fees are set by the El Paso County Clerk and Recorder's Office"},{"bbox":[0.065406983324146087,0.3852941176368202,0.43749997225674719,0.013202122519997972],"confidence":1,"text":"15. Large copies of manuals, books, plans, files, pictures, etc. will be provided on a USB\/flash drive."},{"bbox":[0.065406974939507243,0.36278195489626641,0.68895346901633525,0.015037593841552677],"confidence":1,"text":"General Note 1. The PCD Director may waive or reduce an applicable fee for exceptional circumstance not limited to: a) the elimination of an obsolete zoning"},{"bbox":[0.065406980509526008,0.34398496288986102,0.32703488436612216,0.01315789391012756],"confidence":1,"text":"designation, b) County-initiated applications, or c) concurrent submittals."},{"bbox":[0.066860475609680323,0.32117647075028533,0.72965115633877842,0.015294117647058791],"confidence":1,"text":"General Note 2. Unless an error has occurred by County staff which resulted in the filing of an unnecessary application, no refunds will be granted for applications that"},{"bbox":[0.065406979949533844,0.30235294100112031,0.17296511563387784,0.013529411764705901],"confidence":1,"text":"a review cycle has been preformed on."},{"bbox":[0.065406991305840934,0.2781954885428829,0.71511624422940345,0.015037593841552677],"confidence":1,"text":"General Note 3. For those projects that, because of their size, type of operation, or technical details which are beyond the technical expertise of the El Paso County"},{"bbox":[0.065406973093948398,0.25939849658347014,0.70494185014204547,0.013157893910127449],"confidence":1,"text":"staff and require review and the provision of appropriate technical expert testimony at any required public hearing(s) before the County's governmental bodies or"},{"bbox":[0.065407006338158713,0.2387218048336095,0.72383716930042619,0.015037593841552788],"confidence":1,"text":"contracted employees of the County, the costs for said review and the provision of said expert shall be paid by the applicant. The extent and nature of said costs shall"},{"bbox":[0.065406989970172982,0.21992481247476092,0.36773254394531252,0.013157893910127449],"confidence":1,"text":"be established between the applicant and El Paso County prior to formal submittal."},{"bbox":[0.47529069851094102,0.039411764700474028,0.049418601989746069,0.013219814300537203],"confidence":1,"text":"Page 5 of 5"}],"os_version":"Version 26.6.2 (Build 25G83)","revision":3}